      "statement": "The PlatformAdapter interface in src/platform/adapter.ts is the architectural seam abstracting file I/O and PDF loading; getPlatform() in src/platform/index.ts is a singleton factory returning ElectronAdapter when isElectron() is true, otherwise createUnsupportedAdapter().",
