      "statement": "Undo/redo stores whole-project snapshots in past/future HistoryEntry[] (capped at 100, session-only). Each entry is {project, paperId}; consecutive edits to the same field coalesce into one undo step via a module-level lastFieldKey, while add/remove/paper-switch reset it. PDF mark mutations each push their own snapshot, and history is cleared on project load.",
