      "id": "claim_fd541c4efcfa407481a99c30c56c1d8c",
      "statement": "editorStore.ts (src/state/editorStore.ts) is a separate Zustand+immer store holding the project editor draft, working on the raw JSON shape rather than the loaded Project so editing the schema never prunes existing annotation data; on save it writes the JSON and hands it to the main store via loadFromText. It has its own undo/redo history and commits the focused edit before saving.",
