      "statement": "gitStore.ts (src/state/gitStore.ts) is a separate Zustand+immer store for the clone flow and commit/pull/push/merge/branch/history panel. Its dependency direction is one-way: gitStore reads and drives useStore via useStore.getState(), but store.ts never imports gitStore — so refreshing the repo when the open project changes is an effect in App.tsx, not a call from store.ts.",
