      "id": "claim_8f537e6b718a490da4fed02b7665c379",
      "statement": "vite.config.ts uses base: './' (works from server subpath and file://), injects __APP_VERSION__ from package.json, and conditionally adds vite-plugin-electron when ELECTRON=1: main is electron/main.ts and preload is emitted as CJS with a .cjs extension (package is type: module). The renderer is a plain web build with no Node in the renderer.",
